WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.956 --> 00:00:09.294
SOUTH KOREA NEXT MONTH.

00:00:07.825 --> 00:00:12.163
IF YOU WERE IN THE U.S.

00:00:09.427 --> 00:00:13.298
ILLEGALLY, WOULD YOU SAY SO ON A

00:00:12.297 --> 00:00:15.733
CENSUS FORM?

00:00:13.431 --> 00:00:16.834
THAT'S THE SUBJECT OF INTENSE

00:00:15.867 --> 00:00:18.736
AND EMOTIONAL DEBATE TONIGHT

00:00:16.968 --> 00:00:20.104
AFTER THE COMMERCE DEPARTMENT

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:22.473
ANNOUNCEMENT THAT A CITIZENSHIP

00:00:20.238 --> 00:00:23.975
QUESTION WILL BE ON THE 2020

00:00:22.607 --> 00:00:24.642
CENSUS.

00:00:24.108 --> 00:00:27.512
CORRESPONDENT DOUG McKELWAY

00:00:24.776 --> 00:00:28.713
LOOKS AT WHAT THAT MEANS.

00:00:27.645 --> 00:00:29.981
&gt;&gt; THE ADMINISTRATION DELIVER

00:00:28.846 --> 00:00:33.518
THE NEWS QUIETLY BE A PRESS

00:00:30.114 --> 00:00:34.953
RELEASE LAST NIGHT AT 9:29 P.M.

00:00:33.651 --> 00:00:36.120
AFTER WEEKS OF BUILDING

00:00:35.086 --> 00:00:37.522
CONTROVERSY.

00:00:36.254 --> 00:00:39.924
"TODAY THE U.S. DEPARTMENT OF

00:00:37.655 --> 00:00:40.592
COMMERCE ANNOUNCED A QUESTION ON

00:00:40.058 --> 00:00:45.763
CITIZENSHIP STATUS WILL BE

00:00:40.725 --> 00:00:46.497
REINSTATED TO THE 2020 CENSUS."

00:00:45.897 --> 00:00:48.066
IMMIGRATION GROUPS REACTED WITH

00:00:46.631 --> 00:00:50.635
EXPECTED OUTRAGE.

00:00:48.199 --> 00:01:00.411
CALIFORNIA'S ATTORNEY GENERAL

00:00:50.768 --> 00:01:01.045
PRIMITIVELY FILED SUIT.

00:01:00.545 --> 00:01:01.746
SUPPORTERS NOTED THAT THE

00:01:01.179 --> 00:01:02.280
QUESTION HAVE BEEN INCLUDED IN

00:01:01.879 --> 00:01:04.082
CENSUSES UNTIL 1950.

00:01:02.413 --> 00:01:04.449
&gt;&gt; THERE'S NO PROOF HE PREVENTED

00:01:04.215 --> 00:01:07.919
ANYONE --

00:01:04.582 --> 00:01:08.620
THE ATTORNEY GENERAL OF

00:01:08.052 --> 00:01:10.088
CALIFORNIA XAVIER BECERRA HAS

00:01:08.753 --> 00:01:10.588
SUED SAYING IT IS

00:01:10.221 --> 00:01:14.926
UNCONSTITUTIONAL.

00:01:10.722 --> 00:01:18.096
&gt;&gt; IN THE LETTER REQUESTING THE

00:01:15.059 --> 00:01:20.665
CHANGE IN DECEMBER, DOJ NOTED

00:01:18.229 --> 00:01:21.766
CITIZENSHIP DATA IS CRITICAL TO

00:01:20.798 --> 00:01:22.400
IMPORTANT PRODUCTIONS.

00:01:21.899 --> 00:01:24.168
IMMIGRATION RIGHTS GROUPS

00:01:22.533 --> 00:01:27.705
REJECTED IT.

00:01:24.302 --> 00:01:28.306
&gt;&gt; WE SEE THIS AS AN

00:01:27.839 --> 00:01:30.108
INTIMIDATION DESIGNED TO

00:01:28.439 --> 00:01:30.775
FRIGHTEN IMMIGRANTS FROM NOT

00:01:30.241 --> 00:01:32.944
PARTICIPATING IN THE SENSES.

00:01:30.908 --> 00:01:34.712
&gt;&gt; PRESS SECRETARY SARAH SANDERS

00:01:33.077 --> 00:01:35.179
DENIED THE CHANGE CAME FROM THE

00:01:34.846 --> 00:01:36.848
WHITE HOUSE.

00:01:35.313 --> 00:01:39.317
&gt;&gt; THE WHITE HOUSE SUPPORTS IT

00:01:36.981 --> 00:01:41.019
BUT THE DECISION WAS MADE BY THE

00:01:39.450 --> 00:01:42.520
DEPARTMENT.

00:01:41.152 --> 00:01:43.521
&gt;&gt; BOTH SIDES AGREE NOT

00:01:42.654 --> 00:01:44.722
PARTICIPATING IN THE CENSUS

00:01:43.655 --> 00:01:46.691
SKUs DATA WHICH HELPS

00:01:44.856 --> 00:01:47.258
DETERMINE THE ALLOCATION OF

00:01:46.824 --> 00:01:49.093
GOVERNMENT RESOURCES.

00:01:47.392 --> 00:01:49.794
&gt;&gt; HOW THE DISTRICTS ARE DRAWN

00:01:49.227 --> 00:01:52.263
HAS ENORMOUS APPLICATIONS FOR

00:01:49.927 --> 00:01:54.666
HOW MUCH POLITICAL

00:01:52.397 --> 00:01:58.036
REPRESENTATION YOU HAVE.

00:01:54.799 --> 00:02:02.974
THE CHANCE OF YOUR CANDIDATE

00:01:58.169 --> 00:02:03.608
WINNING.

00:02:03.107 --> 00:02:05.176
&gt;&gt; IN 2010, CENSUS TAKERS

00:02:03.741 --> 00:02:07.912
DOCUMENTED A SIGNIFICANT

00:02:05.309 --> 00:02:09.313
INCREASE IN LEGAL AND ILLEGAL

00:02:08.046 --> 00:02:10.114
NONCITIZENS.

00:02:09.447 --> 00:02:10.715
THE STATE GAINED FIVE

00:02:10.248 --> 00:02:12.717
CONGRESSIONAL SEATS.

00:02:10.848 --> 00:02:14.519
THERE ARE DOUBTS WHETHER A

00:02:12.850 --> 00:02:15.253
CITIZENSHIP QUESTION WOULD

00:02:14.652 --> 00:02:16.788
SUBSTANTIALLY DETER IMMIGRANTS

00:02:15.386 --> 00:02:17.121
FROM PARTICIPATING IN THE

00:02:16.921 --> 00:02:18.956
CENSUS.

00:02:17.255 --> 00:02:20.958
&gt;&gt; WE ASK IT ON THE SERIES OF

00:02:19.090 --> 00:02:23.127
OTHER CENSUS QUESTIONS.

00:02:21.092 --> 00:02:24.128
NOT ONLY CITIZENSHIP BUT A WHOLE

00:02:23.261 --> 00:02:24.495
DETAILED SET OF RELATED

00:02:24.262 --> 00:02:28.900
QUESTIONS.

00:02:24.629 --> 00:02:30.735
&gt;&gt; 2.1% OF RESPONDENTS FAILED TO

00:02:29.033 --> 00:02:31.703
SHARE CITIZENSHIP DATA.

