NEW YORK ATTORNEY GENERAL ERIC

00:02:31.836 --> 00:02:36.708
SCHNEIDERMAN SAID HE WILL JOIN

00:02:34.806 --> 00:02:37.408
CALIFORNIA'S ATTORNEY GENERAL

00:02:36.841 --> 00:02:40.945
LEADING A MULTISTATE LAWSUIT

00:02:37.542 --> 00:02:42.747
SHOULD PRESERVE WHAT HE CALLS A

